    "Expert mean-of-two and nonexpert median are separate constructs. Rating counts, questions and requests are not independent work or rater units.",
    "Assessment bounds concern missing rubric assessments. Conditional work-tuple ranges are not population confidence intervals or cluster-aware uncertainty.",
    "Conditional draws preserve duplicate multiplicity and fixed signed left-minus-right order. Any undefined draw nulls its range; none is silently discarded or replaced.",
    "No random/length or other simple baseline is asserted measured. TTCW14 is the recorded comparator; no unmatched leaderboard, winner, superiority, promotion or causal claim.",
    "Private retained inputs and exact actual invocation receipts are required for regeneration. No source/replay/scorer/provider imports occur in this projection."
